{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Short Oval Extreme</strong></i> is the definitive video game experience for fans of UK short oval racing, bringing the fast-paced, full-contact excitement of the real sport to life like never before. Launching with the legendary <strong>BriSCA Formula 1 Stock Cars</strong>, this game captures the roar of V8 power, the chaos of bumper-to-bumper action, and the adrenaline of racing wheel-to-wheel on tight oval tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge across <strong>real-world UK circuits</strong> faithfully recreated in stunning detail \u2013 from the shale of Owlerton Stadium to the tarmac of Skegness Raceway, every track has its own character, every surface affects your grip and handling, and every race is a battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Early Access Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Authentic Short Oval Racing:</strong> Drive on accurately drone scanned recreated tarmac and shale tracks across the UK. Skegness, Sheffield and Scunthorpe are ready to race on, more will follow with\u00a0Skegness Stadium, Buxton Raceway, Northampton, Hednesford, Ipswich, Mildenhall, Aldershot, Yarmouth, Owlerton and Eastbourne all official.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Time of Day:</strong> Compete in changing conditions taken real time from the tracks location that challenge your control and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Force Feedback &amp; Wheel Support:</strong>\u00a0Steering wheel compatibility via in menu control mapping. I plan to add force feedback support asap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaeCurrently, hot lap mode is available using one of 44 real drivers. I plan to add more features  during early access.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757290?t=1764835329","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757290/da24ac038b03b927483d0a964b78ffcaf0cd1d48/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764835329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757290/168e2588d8ec3fa3b2e8581f12f5d02aa8ccaee8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764835329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757290/168e2588d8ec3fa3b2e8581f12f5d02aa8ccaee8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764835329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Short Oval Extreme</strong></i> is the definitive video game experience for fans of UK short oval racing, bringing the fast-paced, full-contact excitement of the real sport to life like never before. Launching with the legendary <strong>BriSCA Formula 1 Stock Cars</strong>, this game captures the roar of V8 power, the chaos of bumper-to-bumper action, and the adrenaline of racing wheel-to-wheel on tight oval tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge across <strong>real-world UK circuits</strong> faithfully recreated in stunning detail \u2013 from the shale of Owlerton Stadium to the tarmac of Skegness Raceway, every track has its own character, every surface affects your grip and handling, and every race is a battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Early Access Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Authentic Short Oval Racing:</strong> Drive on accurately drone scanned recreated tarmac and shale tracks across the UK. Skegness, Sheffield and Scunthorpe are ready to race on, more will follow with\u00a0Skegness Stadium, Buxton Raceway, Northampton, Hednesford, Ipswich, Mildenhall, Aldershot, Yarmouth, Owlerton and Eastbourne all official.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Time of Day:</strong> Compete in changing conditions taken real time from the tracks location that challenge your control and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Force Feedback &amp; Wheel Support:</strong>\u00a0Steering wheel compatibility via in menu control mapping. I plan to add force feedback support asap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaeCurrently, hot lap mode is available using one of 44 real drivers. I plan to add more features  during early access.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Dangerous Derk Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757290/6ac3630a964377064d9ca07b5873d0e39a689fe3/header.jpg?t=1764835329","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3757290/292608317/b443af8cba3603971a0a547cd7e2e3d222324b0e/1751021111/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751024723","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3757290/292608317/b443af8cba3603971a0a547cd7e2e3d222324b0e/1751021111/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751024723","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3757290/292608317/b443af8cba3603971a0a547cd7e2e3d222324b0e/1751021111/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751024723","id":257162333,"name":"Work In Progress Footage","thumbnail":"https://shared.aka